<title>USA: Nasdaq Oct short interest drops to 1.30 bln shrs.</title>
<headline>Nasdaq Oct short interest drops to 1.30 bln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nasdaq stock market said Thursday short interest decreased to 1.30 billion shares at October 15.</p>
<p>That was a reduction from the September 13 total of 1.32 billion shares.</p>
</text>
